<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Logout | MyBlog</title>

    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
      }

      .logout-container {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 430px;
        background: white;
        padding: 45px 35px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      .logout-icon {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        margin: 0 auto 20px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #f1f3ff;
        font-size: 38px;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #222;
        font-size: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      p {
        color: #666;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      .buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 15px;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .btn {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 13px 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: bold;
        transition: 0.3s;
      }

      .logout-btn {
        color: white;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff416c, #ff4b2b);
      }

      .logout-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(255, 65, 108, 0.3);
      }

      .cancel-btn {
        color: #555;
        background: #f1f1f1;
      }

      .cancel-btn:hover {
        background: #e5e5e5;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .brand {
        margin-top: 28px;
        color: #999;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 500px) {
        .logout-container {
          padding: 35px 25px;
        }

        .buttons {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="logout-container">
      <div class="logout-icon">🚪</div>

      <h1>Ready to Leave?</h1>

      <p>
        Are you sure you want to log out of your account? You can always come
        back and continue sharing your blogs.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a href="/user/logout" class="btn logout-btn"> Yes, Logout </a>

        <a href="/blog/" class="btn cancel-btn"> Cancel </a>
      </div>

      <div class="brand">MyBlog &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %></div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
